msgid ""
"All the code and data included in Bibledit that does not fall in the above "
"license categories has been licensed as mentioned in various bits of source "
"code included in Bibledit."
msgstr "Alle code en gegevens in Bibledit die niet onder de bovenstaande licentiecategorieën vallen, zijn gelicentieerd zoals vermeld in verschillende stukken broncode in Bibledit."

