msgid ""
"To which city was Paul travelling when a light from heaven shone round about "
"him?"
msgstr ""
"Naar welke stad was Paulus op reis toen een licht van de hemel hem rondom "
"bescheen?"

msgid "Damascus"
msgstr "Damascus"

msgid ""
"And while he travelled, he came near Damascus; and suddenly a light from "
"heaven shone round about him."
msgstr ""
"En terwijl hij reisde kwam hij in de buurt van Damascus; en plotseling "
"bescheen een licht van de hemel hem rondom."

msgid "What is the name of the brother of Aaron the high priest?"
msgstr "Wat is de naam van de broer van Aaron de hogepriester?"

msgid "Moses"
msgstr "Mozes"

msgid ""
"And the anger of Jehova was kindled against Moses, and he said: Is not Aaron "
"the Levite your brother?"
msgstr ""
"En de toorn van Jehova ontstak tegen Mozes, en hij zei: Is Aaron de Leviet "
"niet uw broer?"

msgid "What is the name of the city where Jesus was born?"
msgstr "Wat is de naam van de stad waar Jezus geboren is?"

msgid "Bethlehem"
msgstr "Bethlehem"

msgid ""
"When Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judaea in the days of Herod the king, "
"behold, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem."
msgstr ""
"Toen Jezus geboren was in Bethlehem van Judea in de dagen van Herodes de "
"koning, zie, er kwamen wijzen uit het oosten naar Jeruzalem"

msgid "What is the name of the island where John was sent to?"
msgstr "Hoe heet het eiland waar Johannes heen was gestuurd?"

msgid "Patmos"
msgstr "Patmos"

msgid ""
"I, John, your brother and companion in the persecution, and in the kingdom "
"and endurance of Jesus Christ, was in the island called Patmos, because of "
"the word of God, and because of the testimony of Jesus Christ."
msgstr "Ik, Johannes, uw broeder en medegenoot in de verdrukking en in het koninkrijk en in het volharden van Jezus Christus, was op het eiland dat Patmos heet, vanwege het woord van God en het getuigenis van Jezus Christus."

msgid "Who is the first person to acknowledge Jesus as the Christ?"
msgstr "Wie was de eerste die Jezus als de Christus erkende?"

msgid "Simeon"
msgstr "Simeon"

msgid ""
"There was Simeon. A just and devout man. The Holy Spirit told him that he "
"will see Christ before his death."
msgstr "Er was Simeon. Een rechtvaardig en godvrezend man. De Heilige Geest had hem gezegd dat hij de Christus zou zien vóór zijn dood."

msgid "To whom was the Acts Of Apostles written?"
msgstr "Aan wie is Handelingen van de Apostelen geschreven?"

msgid "Theophilus"
msgstr "Theofilus"

msgid ""
"The former treatise have I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both "
"to do and teach,"
msgstr "Het eerste boek heb ik geschreven, o Theofilus, over alles wat Jezus begon te doen en te leren,"

msgid "Where did Jesus met the woman from Samaria?"
msgstr "Waar ontmoette Jezus de vrouw uit Samaria?"

msgid "Jacob's well"
msgstr "Jakobs bron"

msgid ""
"Jesus being wearied by his journey, sat on Jacob's well. Then came a woman "
"from Samaria to get water."
msgstr "Jezus, vermoeid van de reis, zat bij de bron van Jakob. Toen kwam er een vrouw uit Samaria om water te putten."

msgid "Who was the father of Abraham?"
msgstr "Wie was de vader van Abraham?"

msgid "Terah"
msgstr "Terach"

msgid "And Terah took Abram his son,"
msgstr "En Terach nam Abram, zijn zoon,"

msgid "Who was the son of Cush, the mighty hunter before the Lord?"
msgstr "Wie was de zoon van Kus, de machtige jager voor het aangezicht van de HEER?"

msgid "Nimrod"
msgstr "Nimrod"

msgid "And Cush bore Nimrod. He was a mighty hunter before the Lord."
msgstr "En Kus verwekte Nimrod. Hij was een machtig jager voor het aangezicht van de HEER."

msgid "What is the name of Job's friend that answered him first?"
msgstr "Hoe heet de vriend van Job die hem als eerste antwoordde?"

msgid "Eliphaz"
msgstr "Elifaz"

msgid "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said to Job."
msgstr "Toen antwoordde Elifaz, de Temaniet, en zei tegen Job."

msgid "What is the name of Ruth's husband?"
msgstr "Hoe heet de man van Ruth?"

msgid "Boaz"
msgstr "Boaz"

msgid "So Boaz took Ruth as his wife."
msgstr "Zo nam Boaz Ruth tot vrouw."

msgid "Who taught Lemuel Proverbs chapter 31?"
msgstr "Wie leerde Lemuël Spreuken hoofdstuk 31?"

msgid "Lemuel's mother"
msgstr "Lemuëls moeder"

msgid "The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him."
msgstr "De woorden van koning Lemuël, de godsspraak waarmee zijn moeder hem onderwees."

msgid "Who is the chosen people of God in the Old Testament?"
msgstr "Wie is het uitverkoren volk van God in het Oude Testament?"

msgid "Israel"
msgstr "Israël"

msgid "Israel, you are the chosen people of the Lord your God."
msgstr "Israël, u bent het uitverkoren volk van de HEER, uw God."

msgid "Where did God rescue Israel from?"
msgstr "Waar redde God Israël vandaan?"

msgid "Egypt"
msgstr "Egypte"

msgid "Then with his mighty arm, he rescued you from Egypt."
msgstr "Toen redde Hij u met zijn machtige arm uit Egypte."

msgid "Who's the father of Abimelech?"
msgstr "Wie is de vader van Abimelech?"

msgid "Gideon"
msgstr "Gideon"

msgid "Abimelech the son of Gideon went to Shechem."
msgstr "Abimelech, de zoon van Gideon, ging naar Sichem."

msgid "Who's the father of Joshua the priest in the time of Ezra?"
msgstr "Wie is de vader van Jozua de priester in de tijd van Ezra?"

msgid "Jozadak"
msgstr "Jozadak"

msgid "The priest Joshua son of Jozadak."
msgstr "De priester Jozua, de zoon van Jozadak."

msgid "Who's the king of Babylonia, that captures Israel?"
msgstr "Wie is de koning van Babylonië die Israël gevangen neemt?"

msgid "Nebuchadnezzar"
msgstr "Nebukadnezar"

msgid ""
"We were told that their people had made God angry, and he let them be "
"captured by Nebuchadnezzar, the king of Babylonia."
msgstr "Ons werd verteld dat hun volk God boos had gemaakt en Hij liet hen gevangennemen door Nebukadnezar, de koning van Babylonië."

msgid ""
"Who prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus the Persian?"
msgstr "Wie was voorspoedig in de regering van Darius en in de regering van Cyrus de Pers?"

msgid ""
"So this Daniel prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus "
"the Persian."
msgstr "Zo was deze Daniël voorspoedig in de regering van Darius en in de regering van Cyrus de Pers."

msgid "Who's Abram's brother's son?"
msgstr "Wie is de zoon van Abrams broer?"

msgid "Lot"
msgstr "Lot"

msgid ""
"And they took Lot, Abram's brother's son, who dwelt in Sodom, and his goods, "
"and departed."
msgstr "En zij namen Lot, de zoon van Abrams broer, die in Sodom woonde, en zijn have, en vertrokken."

msgid "Who wrote Song of Songs?"
msgstr "Wie schreef het Hooglied?"

msgid "Solomon"
msgstr "Salomo"

msgid "This is Solomon's most beautiful song."
msgstr "Dit is het mooiste lied van Salomo."

msgid "Who's the father of Hosea?"
msgstr "Wie is de vader van Hosea?"

msgid "Beeri"
msgstr "Beëri"

msgid "I am Hosea son of Beeri."
msgstr "Ik ben Hosea, de zoon van Beëri."

msgid "Username should be at least four characters long"
msgstr "De gebruikersnaam moet minstens vier tekens lang zijn"

